# Internal docs kept in the private workspace companion
# (prime/private/chain-notes-app) — not published in this (public-ready)
# repo. Copies live there; these are the working-tree originals a local
# checkout may still have on disk from before the move.
/CLAUDE.md
/DEVELOPMENT.md
/EXTERNAL-FUNDING-STATUS.md
/SIGNING-NOTARIZATION.md
/UPSTREAM-ISSUES.md

# Local signing config symlinked from the private companion (real Team ID) — never publish
/signing.env

# App Store Connect signing + config, symlinked from the private companion
# (prime/private/chain-notes-app/appstore) — certs, ASC key, provisioning
# profiles, team/app ids. Never publish.
/appstore

# App Review contact (real name/email/phone) — symlinked from the private
# appstore/ companion; never publish.
/fastlane/metadata/review_information

